      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eutectic processing promotes a fine lamellar structure containing coexisting FCC and B2 phases.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventionally cast Al–Co–Cr–Fe–Ni HEAs may have coarse, irregular phase distributions.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Conventionally cast Al–Co–Cr–Fe–Ni HEAs may exhibit compositional segregation.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alloy composition should be adjusted toward a eutectic point.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Controlled rapid cooling is required to obtain the proposed eutectic microstructure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A subsequent mild annealing step can be used as part of the phase-control method.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vacuum induction melting at high temperature is a suitable processing route for the eutectic Al–Co–Cr–Fe–Ni alloy.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cooling rates conducive to coupled nucleation of FCC and ordered B2 phases favor eutectic solidification.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cold rolling can optionally be applied after casting.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The structural mediator is a fine lamellar FCC/B2 microstructure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The FCC lamellae are mechanically soft and the ordered B2 lamellae are mechanically hard.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "During a eutectic reaction, the FCC and B2 phases nucleate and grow simultaneously in an interleaved manner.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coupled eutectic growth minimizes compositional segregation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Eutectic solidification produces regular phase spacing.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_card::000::ade5504bfd"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The FCC phase enhances ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The B2 phase acts as a precipitation-strengthening reinforcement.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The controlled lamellar microstructure improves load transfer and work hardening.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
